  "description": "Spread love with this beautiful Love Heart Embroidery Design! ❤️ Featuring elegant script lettering surrounded by adorable hearts, this romantic design is perfect for Valentine’s Day, anniversaries, weddings, couples, and heartfelt gifts.\nThe stylish lettering and heart-filled layout make it a lovely choice for T-shirts, sweatshirts, hoodies, tote bags, pillows, blankets, jackets, caps, wedding gifts, and personalized projects.\n✨ Perfect For:\nValentine’s Day • Love & Romance Projects • Couples • Anniversary Gifts • Wedding Gifts • T-Shirts • Hoodies • Sweatshirts • Tote Bags • Pillows • Blankets • Jackets • Personalized Gifts\nCompatible with Brother, Baby Lock, Janome, Bernina, Husqvarna Viking, Singer, and most embroidery machines.\nThis is a digital embroidery file only. No physical product will be shipped.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Spread love with this beautiful Love Heart Embroidery Design! ❤️ Featuring elegant script lettering surrounded by adorable hearts, this romantic design is perfect for Valentine’s Day, anniversaries, weddings, couples, and heartfelt gifts.</p>\n<p>The stylish lettering and heart-filled layout make it a lovely choice for T-shirts, sweatshirts, hoodies, tote bags, pillows, blankets, jackets, caps, wedding gifts, and personalized projects.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect For:<br>\nValentine’s Day • Love &amp; Romance Projects • Couples • Anniversary Gifts • Wedding Gifts • T-Shirts • Hoodies • Sweatshirts • Tote Bags • Pillows • Blankets • Jackets • Personalized Gifts</p>\n<p>Compatible with Brother, Baby Lock, Janome, Bernina, Husqvarna Viking, Singer, and most embroidery machines.<br>\nThis is a digital embroidery file only. No physical product will be shipped.</p>",
